WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.735
Before writing a brief,

00:00:01.785 --> 00:00:03.209
scan the five Cs:

00:00:03.259 --> 00:00:04.059
company,

00:00:03.955 --> 00:00:04.755
culture,

00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:05.475
category,

00:00:05.394 --> 00:00:07.618
connections and consumer.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:09.133
Say the brief is a low-sugar sports drink.

00:00:08.628 --> 00:00:09.428
The company has a new line.

00:00:09.265 --> 00:00:13.731
And culture?

00:00:13.781 --> 00:00:15.835
Run clubs are booming.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:19.042
Gatorade and Powerade own the category.

00:00:19.092 --> 00:00:20.363
Runners live on Strava and TikTok.

00:00:20.413 --> 00:00:22.886
And the consumer?

00:00:22.936 --> 00:00:25.499
Someone who just finished a race.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.591
So pull one implication from each C,

00:00:28.641 --> 00:00:32.206
then boil them down to a single insight for the brief.
